In this document, we will set the standards for the sizes of each of the images that will be assets


Here is a simple visualization

            _________________________________________
            |                                       |
Sky     ->  |                                       |
            |_____----^^^----_____                  |
Back    ->  |                     ******------______|
            |##      ###   ##    ###   ###    ###   |
            |###    ##### ####  ##### #####  ##### #|
Mid     ->  |!!      !!!   !!    !!!   !!!    !!!   |
Fore    ->  |!ooo    !!ooo !! oo !!!  oo!!   ooo!   |
            |^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^|
            |         _______________________       |
Game    ->  |        |_____|_____|_____|_____|      |
            |        |_____|_____|_____|_____|      |
Grid    ->  |        |_____|_____|_____|_____|      |
            |        |_____|_____|_____|_____|      |
            |        |_____|_____|_____|_____|      |
            |                                       |
            _________________________________________

Floor Art will be set to: 

Sky     : 320 x 360
Back    : 320 x 360
Mid     : 320 x 360
Fore    : 320 x 360
Game    : 320 x 360
Tile    : 320 x 360

This is because all the art is the same size in terms of filling the top 40% of the screen with a 16:9 ratio


Here are the tones to recolour from darkest to lightest:

in RGB
1 : 45,45,45
2 : 85,85,85
3 : 125,125,125
4 : 165,165,165
5 : 215,215,215
6 : 255,255,255
